  "description": "Inframe is a tilted cube frame that invites children to picture themselves inside a picture frame and then find a way out. The structure is Lemon Yellow with navy, and it carries a tube slide, rope nets, a spiral climber and a geoboard where children can make shapes. It suits ages 5 to 12, takes up to 15 children, and needs a safe play area of 21'9\" x 19'3\" for a product area of 16'3\" x 14'9\". The mix of climbing, sliding and shape-making builds hand-eye coordination, arm strength, imagination and thinking skills. As part of our Nature Sparsh range it carries a 3-year warranty on its main materials. Write to sales@funplaysystems.com with your site details.",
